Subject: [lilith-core-seam] Preserve explicit empty CLI toolsets

Hermes' gateway currently adds coding/project/desktop toolsets even when
`platform_toolsets.cli: []` is explicitly saved. Preserve that operator choice
as AIAgent's existing `[]` no-tools representation. Environment pins and every
non-empty/default configuration retain their upstream behavior.

Upstream base: 3c5fd918e3e2537cd74f4f88c990c5de5cbd9f63

diff --git a/tests/tui_gateway/test_gui_surface_toolsets.py b/tests/tui_gateway/test_gui_surface_toolsets.py
